Verse 1
[F]Tell me the old, old [Bb]story of [C]unseen things a[F]bove,
of Jesus and his [Bb]glory, of [C]Jesus and his [F]love.

Chorus
Tell me the old, old [Bb]story, [C]tell me the old, old [F]story,
tell me the old, old [Bb]story of [C]Jesus and his [F]love.
